# The map movement sprites, in the order they are placed from start to end:
# the lower halves of banks $C1-$C7 (tools/stream_layout.py). Each NAME is
# NAME.4bpp.png here (8 KB sprites 4 tiles wide, 5 KB ones 2), built through
# NAME.4bpp.lz; NAME.4bpp.comp is the stream as the ROM has it. The region
# ends where other data begins, so an edited sprite must not compress larger.
start $C10000
end $C70C80

g4bppcMageFemaleMapMovementSprite MageFemale
g4bppcMageMapMovementSprite Mage
